---
description: VEDA project rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Source of truth: docs/BUILD_BRIEF.md and CLAUDE.md.
- Agents get data only via run_sql() (Zetaris). Models only via Nightshift (`fast`, `deep`), never meterless/auto.
- Every agent step writes a JSONL trace line. No hard-coded outputs or demo-only branches.
- Never write secrets into code, logs, fixtures or docs.
- Safety: no NORMAL on missing/stale data; never advise wading/driving through water; always "not an official warning".
